{
  "uid": "taskboard-observabilite",
  "title": "TaskBoard — observer avant de conclure",
  "tags": [
    "DevOps",
    "laboratoire"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Du symptôme à la requête",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Comparer **normal**, **lent** et **erreur**. Les métriques regroupent les requêtes ; elles ne prouvent pas la cause. Dans les journaux, ouvrir **TraceID** pour retrouver la durée HTTP et le span PostgreSQL. Les trois API lisent une **copie** de la base, avec un rôle sans droit d’écriture. Les seuils ci-dessous sont pédagogiques."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requêtes métier par seconde",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (scenario, status) (rate(taskboard_http_requests_total{route=~\"/api/tasks.*\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}} · {{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p95 estimé de la durée HTTP",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (scenario, le) (rate(taskboard_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=~\"/api/tasks.*\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Réponses 5xx parmi les requêtes métier",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (scenario) (rate(taskboard_http_requests_total{route=~\"/api/tasks.*\",status=~\"5..\"}[1m])) / clamp_min(sum by (scenario) (rate(taskboard_http_requests_total{route=~\"/api/tasks.*\"}[1m])), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Alertes actuellement déclenchées",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\",environnement=\"laboratoire\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{alertname}} · {{scenario}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "DÉCLENCHÉE",
                  "color": "red"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Journaux corrélés — ouvrir TraceID dans les détails",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service_name=\"taskboard\"} | json",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true
      }
    }
  ]
}
